WEBVTT

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:41.130
"There shall come a controller of a dark
star who shall call forth the light."

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.140
"And the world shall be
flooded with darkness."

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:44.800
"Dragon's blood shall spread..."

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.710
"...and following the power
between light and darkness..."

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.770
"...a single star
shall be awakened."

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:52.310
"Around the star
shall spin five lights."

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:55.440
"And the power shall be
a darkness beyond twilight."

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:57.610
"A brilliance beyond the dawn."

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:00.390
"When the power is loosed,
we shall fall to an arrow..."

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:03.020
"...which will split
the heavens apart."

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:08.060
Or so that crazy prophecy that's been
sending us all over the place says.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:10.530
Last time, we found a temple
of the Ancient Dragons...

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:13.070
...built in a land
of ice and snow.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:14.830
Could we finally be
near the climax?

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:17.030
What secrets does
the temple hide?

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:20.100
And where is the
final Darkstar weapon?

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:51.800
G- Golden dragons!

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.400
What's going on here?

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.210
Why have the golden
dragons come here?

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:26.710
Supreme Elder...
What are you doing here?

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:29.770
Is it only you here?

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:37.110
I asked if only you
people were here, Filia!

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:40.820
And... To Xellos
and the Overworlder!

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.000
Well, if it isn't
the Supreme Elder.

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:54.160
It's been quite a while.
By the way...

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:58.440
What brings you to this
temple of the Ancient Dragons?

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:04.240
Our goal is to preserve
peace in this world!

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:05.950
Oh?

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:10.310
Meaning whatever is
behind this barrier...

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.050
...will upset the
peace of this world.

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:20.460
In that case,
will you let us see it?

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:47.910
Why are they?!

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:58.830
One move and
and you're dead, Filia.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:01.130
Xellos! What are you?!

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.070
Now, then, Supreme Elder.

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:05.900
Will you please remove
the barrier for us?

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:08.440
Y- You can't!

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:14.180
Will you please ask the
Supreme Elder as well, Filia?

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:15.880
Xellos...

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:20.620
It's useless. I won't comply
no matter who you kill.

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:25.130
We will do nothing to endanger
the peace of the world!

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:26.480
Supreme Elder!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.200
If they are attacking us...

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:40.540
...it means there's something
here worth defending!

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:41.540
What?

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:42.480
I get you.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:45.450
And from this situation,
I can only conclude...

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:48.480
...that it must be Galvayra,
the final weapon!

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:52.420
The final Darkstar weapon...
Galvayra.

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:55.620
You mean we've
finally made it?

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:56.590
At last...

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.320
In that case...

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.160
No, don't!

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:31.620
Horrible...

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:33.760
How could he?

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.260
Can't they see they're
no match for him?!

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:47.170
I'll cast a resurrection
spell on you!

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:52.540
D- Don't bother...
It's... It's too late...

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:55.450
Why did you do this?!

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:59.620
We have pledged
our lives to do our duty...

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:04.490
...to protect the
peace of this world.

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:08.320
And that pledge is supposed to
give meaning to your death?!

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:14.000
The Supreme Elder
is in this temple...

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:19.200
- I beg of you...
- The Supreme Elder is here?

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:23.710
Looks that way.
Along with the final weapon.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.890
Do what you please.

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:41.360
No matter what happens, I will not
hand over the final weapon to you.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:47.960
No... He'd even sacrifice
his own people for this?!

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:51.240
I see... You knew
from the start...

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:54.500
...the final weapon
was here, didn't you?

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.140
What of it?

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:03.950
Now that I know that, I must
insist that you break the barrier.

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:06.180
I'll force you to.

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:13.530
Useless. We servants of the Gods
cannot break this final barrier.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:19.800
This final barrier
wasn't cast by us...

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:23.100
...but by the Ancient
Dragons themselves!

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.690
This... This is awful.

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:54.300
With this final weapon,
the Ancient Dragons...

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:57.900
...turned against we
who serve the Gods.

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:04.480
But we destroyed them before they
could become enemies of the world.

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:09.780
And then we left
the Darkstar weapon...

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:12.720
...sealed behind the
barrier they created.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:13.880
It's a lie...

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:17.690
After that, we kept
the Darkstar weapon...

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:20.820
...sealed from the eyes
of all the others.

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:24.090
Beyond that, we cast many
more barriers...

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:26.530
...in order to protect it.

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:29.870
It's not true...
He's lying even now!

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:31.100
You're lying!

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:35.780
Weren't they killed because
they refused to fight for you?!

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:40.710
Silence, Filia! No matter what the
Ancient Dragons' intentions were...

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:45.720
...only we could be trusted to
hold a weapon this powerful!

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:49.810
It appears the Ancient Dragons
hid it inside this barrier...

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:53.430
...because they didn't
want YOU to get it.

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:57.900
I think they understood
what that would have meant.

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:03.140
It seems the Ancient
Dragons used their powers...

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:06.770
...to invert the Darkstar weapon's
power to create this barrier.

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:11.170
Meaning the only one
who could break it...

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.910
...would have to be descended from
the Ancient Dragons themselves.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:19.790
Now, then...

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:46.310
Now, then, to think of a
way to break this barrier.

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:48.890
You think a method
even exists?

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:51.400
Oh? Why should you care?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.690
What?

00:10:53.570 --> 00:11:00.030
You should be more concerned
with your own health, Elder.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:04.540
Now that I know you
can't break this barrier...

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:06.540
...I have no need for you.

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:07.740
Xellos!

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:11.750
I doubt you'll just
sit by quietly.

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:15.740
I should eliminate all
possible obstacles quickly.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.310
After that, I can take my
time in figuring out...

00:11:18.390 --> 00:11:20.260
...how to get the final weapon.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:21.880
Prepare to die.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:27.100
Oh, and it's useless to call
your dragon army for help.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:31.330
Did you forget how many dragons
I killed singlehandedly...

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:33.400
...in the War of the
Monsters' Fall?

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:45.180
Even if I die, I won't let
you have the final weapon!

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:49.850
A waste of time...

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:51.820
Supreme Elder!

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:55.920
A meaningless battle...

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:59.960
And all because we
came to this world.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:20.150
An ironic end...

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:26.110
They met the same fate the Ancient
Dragons did at their own hands.

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:31.020
Filia!

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:36.930
Now, then, let's stop
playing around.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.130
Xellos! I won't let you!

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:43.900
"Anaku soro'mu nazak'u sakriim...
Chaotic Disintegrate!"

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:47.840
Just what I was waiting for!

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:53.620
Now be cursed,
power of the Gods!

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:56.220
He absorbed it?!

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:05.120
The last time we fused
Holy and Demonic magic...

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:07.760
...we neutralized the
power of Ragud Mezegis!

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:12.240
Meaning it can also break a barrier
powered by another Darkstar weapon!

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:13.960
What have I done?

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.240
I have it!

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:30.890
Miss Lina!

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.480
Now that is what I call
incredibly good timing.

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:35.930
No fair, Lina!

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:39.260
You don't jump on
people's HEADS!

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:40.300
Oh, shut your mouth!

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:43.670
It's your fault for double-
crossing me in the first place!

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:47.570
Figured he'd be up to this.

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:48.540
Up to what?

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:50.930
So, what's the situation now?

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:54.470
The final Darkstar weapon is
inside of this barrier.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:57.170
But the power
generating the barrier...

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:59.740
...will keep anyone
from getting through it.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:04.420
I see. Is that why he just tried
a Light-Dark Fusion Magic spell?

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.820
It's no fair, Lina!

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:08.760
I had it all worked
out and everything!

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:10.650
You turned
against us, remember?

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:12.990
You think we'd let you
get away with this?

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:16.870
In any case, don't try the
same thing again, Xellos.

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:19.000
But there's no other
way to break the barrier...

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:20.660
...so you'll just try the
same thing, right?

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:24.080
Or did you bring those magical
vessels from before with you?

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:25.610
Neither of us has
any alternatives.

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:30.740
So, what do we do now?
Join forces to break the barrier...

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:34.810
...and then see who can sneak away
with the final weapon after that?

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:35.880
Screw that!

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:39.420
Then we'll have to bring
the Darkstar weapons...

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:42.260
...holding the gateway closed
to break the barrier.

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.090
What?!

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:46.520
You mean that
gateway is still open?

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:51.830
Lina Inverse!
I want to make a deal.

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:54.400
There have been too
many sacrifices already.

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:58.740
You're one to talk after you guys
killed all the golden dragons!

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:02.210
Sorry, but we're past
making deals now.

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:03.680
Then I've no choice.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:06.710
Elder, Filia, go for Almayce!

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:09.880
Spells may not work on him,
but your Laser Breath will!

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:11.420
Just buy me a little time!

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:12.390
Right!

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:14.590
You guys, try to hold Xellos off.

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:15.320
Right!

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:17.320
GO!

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.120
DI FLASHER!

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.140
Mr. Xellos!

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.610
We may have fought
together as comrades...

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:38.810
...but now that you've sold
your soul to darkness...

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:39.910
...we'll show you no mercy!

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:43.590
Um, I was always
a Monster, remember?

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:46.850
Mr. Xellos! I'm going to take
advantage of your weakness!

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.420
You don't mean!

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:52.390
Life is wonderful!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:54.560
Living is marvelous!

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:56.620
The world's overflowing
with light and joy!

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.830
Psy- Psychological warfare!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.830
It's common knowledge that
Monsters, who thrive on...

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:04.540
...negative human emotions,
can't stand it when...

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:06.510
...life is praised with
positive feelings!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.770
Okay, Mr. Xellos!
You'd better surrender now!

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:10.680
Oh, crap...

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:14.250
As long as you don't give up,
life always finds a way!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:17.590
No matter how hard life may get,
I'll never run from it!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.680
Oh, life is so wonderful!

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:22.560
Um, guys? Come on...

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:40.710
If we need a spell that combines
the power of the Gods and Monsters...

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.850
...there's only one to use!

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.350
"Lord of the dreams that terrify..."

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:51.420
"Sword of cold and darkness, free
yourself from the heavens' bonds!"

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:54.180
"Become one with my power,
one with my body..."

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:56.590
"...and let us walk the
path of destruction together!"

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:59.100
"Power that can smash
even the souls of the gods!"

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:01.990
RAGNA BLADE!!!

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:03.230
That spell!

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:08.230
A spell that calls on a dark lord
beyond Darkstar or Shabranigdo!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:09.870
The Lord of Nightmares!

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:15.010
The truth is that she
is the mother of all things.

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:18.610
Meaning this spell has the
power of the Gods and the Monsters!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:22.590
This should be able to break
the Ancient Dragons' barrier!

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:46.540
All right!

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:54.880
The final Darkstar
weapon: Galvayra!

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:57.650
This should be more than
enough to let us win.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.850
Huh? This is a bow, right?

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:02.020
What's going on here?!

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:04.030
Where's the string?
And the arrows?!

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:18.740
For the good of both worlds,
I can't let you have that!

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:33.460
Forgive me,
but I'll show you no mercy!

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:37.820
Gotcha! You thought I was
really scared of you?

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:42.100
LIGHT, COME FORTH!

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:01.850
Galvayra?!
Almayce has failed!

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:10.390
This is the power
of the Darkstar weapon...

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:12.430
That thing's incredible!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.490
The Sword of Light
doesn't even come close!

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:20.930
Don't move! Get back!
C'mon, I said get back!

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:23.210
Give Galvayra to me!

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:26.540
I'LL decide if you
guys get it or not!

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:39.590
It's time we got rid of
you once and for all!

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.520
Erulogos!!!

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:51.130
Almayce!

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:54.560
You sons of!
Wasn't Almayce one of you?!

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:56.140
Was he?

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:56.970
What?!

00:19:58.110 --> 00:20:00.940
Now, then, will you
give Galvayra to me?

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.540
Are you kidding?!
One step closer and I shoot!

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:07.250
Resistance is useless.
We're much faster than you.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:13.850
Miss Lina!

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:18.150
Xellos!

00:20:21.270 --> 00:20:22.490
Lina!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:27.300
Forgive me, but I'll
be taking this, thank you.

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:28.460
Xellos!

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:29.770
The final weapon!

00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:30.870
Damn you!

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:33.740
Please don't look so angry!

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:39.680
I said before that getting the
final weapon was what matters.

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:43.950
And the one I meant to
get it in the end was ME.

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:45.810
Now, pardon me.

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:47.560
You son of a!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:55.830
Lina!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:56.770
Miss Lina!

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:03.230
X- Xellos... What are
you trying to do?

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:24.350
Now that you have the final weapon,
just what are you up to, Xellos?!

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:27.320
You'd better not have another
double-cross going on!

00:22:27.390 --> 00:22:30.260
Next time: " No Time for Arguing!
Head for the Showdown!"

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:33.530
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
